#! The only route to utf-32: this server prefers utf-8 whenever it is offered
#! and falls back to utf-16 otherwise, so a client reaches the code-point
#! branch only by offering utf-32 alone. Report 09 recommends exactly this for
#! fackr, whose own tokens are already char-indexed.
name      lifecycle/negotiate-utf32-only
profile   utf32-only

initialize
shutdown
